		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>below, under,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῆς ἐκροῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					112d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἐμοῦ κατακλίνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					222e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑ. τοῦ νοηθέντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					1p.18U.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ Αητῷον, ὃ ὑ. Πουρέου ἐστί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					826
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>E</u>
				34
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>): abs., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				844c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).872.19
			</span></i> (Tenos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. παραγράψαι τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Eux.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			. </div>
